#: ../marketing/guides/operate/rotate-signing-key.md:49
msgid "Doing this everywhere <strong>before</strong> anything signs with the new key is what keeps a load-balanced deployment working: a token one instance signs with the new key is then accepted by every other."
msgstr "在任何实例用新密钥签名<strong>之前</strong>先在所有地方完成这一步，才能确保负载均衡的部署持续正常工作：这样一个实例用新密钥签名的令牌就能被其他每个实例接受。"

#: ../marketing/guides/operate/upgrade-postgres.md:21
