msgstr "从软件包安装 openvoxserver、openvoxdb 和 Postgres，构建控制台，并将其作为 systemd 服务运行。"

#: ../marketing/guides/install/packages.md:36
#~ msgid "Installing the package <strong>already creates the CA and this server's own certificate</strong>, issued for the host's certname, normally its fully qualified name. In the common case there is nothing more to do than start it:"
#~ msgstr "安装该软件包时<strong>就已经创建了 CA 以及这台服务器自己的证书</strong>，签发给主机的 certname，通常就是其完全限定域名。在通常情况下，只需启动它即可："

#: ../marketing/guides/scale/cluster.md:109
msgid "Instances learn about each other's addresses from the cluster itself, and by default those are IP addresses, which a certificate rarely carries. With three or more routed instances, each with its own certificate, set <code>CONSOLE_CLUSTER_ADVERTISE</code> on each to a name in its own certificate, such as <code>console-2.example.com:6222</code>."
msgstr "实例通过集群本身获知彼此的地址，默认情况下这些地址是 IP 地址，而证书中很少包含 IP 地址。如果有三个或更多路由实例且各自持有自己的证书，请在每个实例上把 <code>CONSOLE_CLUSTER_ADVERTISE</code> 设置为其自身证书中的某个名称，例如 <code>console-2.example.com:6222</code>。"

#: ../marketing/guides/scale/cluster.md:16
msgid "Instances sharing a database must be clustered. An instance that is not only learns of a revoked login when it next re-reads revocations from the database, up to 30 seconds later, and cannot reach the nodes connected to any other instance."
msgstr "共享同一数据库的实例必须组成集群。未加入集群的实例只有在下一次从数据库重新读取吊销信息时（最多 30 秒之后）才会得知某个登录已被吊销，而且无法访问连接到其他实例的 Nodes。"

