msgstr "签发它会写入 CA 状态，而运行中的服务器也会写入这些状态，因此签发期间请停止 openvoxserver："

#: ../marketing/guides/operate/postgres-failover.md:21
msgid "It answers <code>t</code>: it is still a replica. A write to it is refused with <code>cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction</code>, which is also what a healthy replica does."
msgstr "它返回 <code>t</code>：它仍然是副本。对它的写入会被拒绝并报 <code>cannot execute INSERT in a read-only transaction</code>，健康的副本也是如此。"

