#: ../marketing/guides/install/packages.md:166
msgid "On Debian and Ubuntu, <code>systemctl status postgresql</code> reads <code>active (exited)</code>, and that is normal: that unit only starts the real per-cluster one. <code>pg_lsclusters</code> shows the cluster itself as <code>online</code>."
msgstr "在 Debian 和 Ubuntu 上，<code>systemctl status postgresql</code> 显示 <code>active (exited)</code>，这是正常的：该单元只负责启动真正的、按集群划分的单元。<code>pg_lsclusters</code> 会显示集群本身为 <code>online</code>。"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/vulnerabilities.md:110
msgid "On Debian and Ubuntu, many vulnerabilities the distribution rates as negligible, or has decided not to fix, still appear, as findings with no fix released. That is why the list starts at \"fix available\"."
msgstr "在 Debian 和 Ubuntu 上，许多被发行版评为可忽略、或已决定不修复的漏洞仍然会出现，表现为尚未发布修复的发现。这就是列表默认从「有可用修复」开始显示的原因。"

#: ../marketing/guides/nodes/add.md:51
