msgid "openvox-server still compiles catalogs and runs the CA; openvoxdb still stores facts and reports. Your agents carry on talking to exactly what they talk to now — the console serves the standard ENC contract, so there is nothing to change on the node side."
msgstr "openvox-server 仍然编译 catalog 并运行 CA；openvoxdb 仍然存储 Facts 和 Reports。你的代理继续与现在完全相同的对象通信——控制台提供标准 ENC 约定，因此 Node 端无需做任何改动。"

