msgid "Which value a node gets"
msgstr "Node 获得哪个值"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/access.md:86
msgid "While an account is locked, its password is refused even when it is right. Failed logins while it is locked do not make the lock longer."
msgstr "账户被锁定期间，即使密码正确也会被拒绝。锁定期间的登录失败不会延长锁定时间。"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/agents.md:117
msgid "Who can approve"
msgstr "谁可以批准"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/run-plans.md:51
msgid "Who can change a plan"
msgstr "谁可以更改 Plan"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/agentless.md:108
msgid "Windows and WinRM, jump hosts, SSH certificates, Puppet runs, patch scans and patch runs, collecting facts, and Puppet-language plans."
msgstr "Windows 和 WinRM、跳板机、SSH 证书、Puppet 运行、补丁扫描和补丁运行、收集 Facts，以及 Puppet 语言 Plans。"

#: ../marketing/templates/pages/features/patching.tmpl:68
msgid "Windows, macOS and zypper (SUSE) nodes are not scanned. They are listed as unable to report, so a gap in coverage is visible rather than mistaken for a clean bill of health."
msgstr "Windows、macOS 和 zypper（SUSE）Nodes 不会被扫描。它们会被列为无法上报，因此覆盖上的缺口一目了然，而不会被误认为一切正常。"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/patching.md:99
msgid "With <a href=\"run-modes.html\">run modes</a>, the scan runs in <code>all</code> and <code>worker</code> instances."
msgstr "使用<a href=\"run-modes.html\">运行模式</a>时，扫描在 <code>all</code> 和 <code>worker</code> 实例中运行。"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/schedule-jobs.md:168
msgid "Without a secrets key, a schedule with a sensitive value is refused. Set <code>CONSOLE_SECRETS_KEY_FILE</code> - see <a href=\"vulnerabilities.html\">Track vulnerabilities</a>, which uses the same key - on every instance that serves the console or runs the scheduler."
msgstr "没有机密密钥时，带有敏感值的计划会被拒绝。请在每个提供控制台服务或运行调度器的实例上设置 <code>CONSOLE_SECRETS_KEY_FILE</code>——参见<a href=\"vulnerabilities.html\">跟踪漏洞</a>，它使用同一个密钥。"

#: ../marketing/guides/use/schedule-jobs.md:83
msgid "You can see and change the schedules you own. Someone whose role is granted on <strong>All Nodes</strong> can see and change everyone's. See <a href=\"access.html\">Users, roles and tokens</a>."
msgstr "你可以查看和更改自己拥有的计划。角色在 <strong>All Nodes</strong> 上被授予的人可以查看和更改所有人的计划。参见<a href=\"access.html\">用户、角色与令牌</a>。"

#: ../marketing/guides/nodes/add.md:106
msgid "You do not run the script again to upgrade the node agent. When you upgrade the console, it upgrades the node agent on each connected node for you; see <a href=\"agent-upgrades.html\">Keep node agents current</a>."
msgstr "升级 Node 代理时无需再次运行脚本。当你升级控制台时，它会替你升级每个已连接 Node 上的 Node 代理；参见<a href=\"agent-upgrades.html\">保持 Node 代理为最新</a>。"

